<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Pals in talks, cautions shareholders.</title>
<headline>Pals in talks, cautions shareholders.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African clothing firm Pals Holdings Ltd said on Friday it was in negotiations which could have an effect on its share price on the Johannesburg Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>The firm said shareholders should exercise caution in their share dealings.</p>
<p>The company gave no further details in a brief announcement. -- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
<p>e-mail: johannesburg.newsroom@reuters.com</p>
